  </div></section><section id="process" data-screen-label="Process" style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0px auto; padding: clamp(70px, 9vw, 120px) clamp(20px, 4vw, 40px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);">
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 420px), 1fr)); gap: 32px; align-items: end;">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px;"><span data-reveal="" style="align-self: flex-start; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(194, 247, 96);"><span style="width: 36px; height: 1.5px; border-radius: 2px; background: currentcolor;"></span>How we work</span><h2 data-reveal="" style="font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 50px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 0.98; text-wrap: balance;"><span style="color: rgb(210, 234, 166);">How We Plan, Launch</span> and Optimise Your Ad Campaigns</h2></div><p data-reveal="" style="font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75); text-wrap: pretty;">A good campaign is planned before it is launched and improved long after. Our process begins with your business goals, moves through audience research and platform planning, and goes live only when conversion tracking is in place. From there we monitor performance closely, test new creatives, copy and audiences, and adjust bids and budgets using real data, so every stage works towards leads, sales and a better return on your ad spend.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);">
    <div data-reveal="" class="scp5" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr)); gap: 20px 40px; padding: 34px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); align-items: start; transition: background 0.4s;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px;"><span style="flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px); line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.06em; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px rgb(194, 247, 96);">01</span><h3 style="font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 32px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1.1;">Understand Business Goals</h3></div>
      <ul style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;"><li style="display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);"><span style="flex: 0 0 auto; width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-top: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(194, 247, 96);"></span>Identify campaign objectives such as lead generation, sales, website traffic or brand awareness.</li><li style="display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);"><span style="flex: 0 0 auto; width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-top: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(194, 247, 96);"></span>Define the key performance indicators (KPIs) used to measure success.</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal="" class="scp5" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 260px), 1fr)); gap: 20px 40px; padding: 34px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); align-items: start; transition: background 0.4s;">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 24px;"><span style="flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px); line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -0.06em; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px rgb(194, 247, 96);">02</span><h3 style="font-size: clamp(22px, 2.4vw, 32px); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1.1;">Research the Target Audience</h3></div>
      <ul style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;"><li style="display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);"><span style="flex: 0 0 auto; width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-top: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(194, 247, 96);"></span>Identify audience demographics, interests, search intent and buying behaviour.</li><li style="display: flex; gap: 12px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);"><span style="flex: 0 0 auto; width: 7px; height: 7px; margin-top: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgb(194, 247, 96);"></span>Understand the target audience's needs and potential barriers to conversion.</li></ul>
